# ChirpParade preset
format = 1
name = Nightingale Song
author = ChirpParade
description = A nightingale does not repeat itself. Across 45 s of the reference it sings 254 syllables from 21 to 1296 ms, over 1644 to 5731 Hz, whose shapes differ from each other by a median pairwise distance of 5.22 -- so this preset runs Variation wide enough to cross the whole archetype set rather than settling on one. Phrases are short, one to sixteen syllables, with the syllables inside a phrase running together and real silence between them.

